ShutdownTest
├── When the timeout has not elapsed
│   └── It should revert.
├── When a VRF request stalls for seven days
│   └── It should close permanently and refund the locked winner.
├── When a stranger closes an idle day after seven days
│   └── It should revert.
├── When the owner closes an idle day after seven days
│   └── It should unlock every standing bid.
├── When a random result is already available
│   └── It should require finalization instead of aborting.
├── When a late callback follows shutdown
│   └── It should ignore the callback.
├── When a refunded winner withdraws twice
│   └── It should revert on the second withdrawal.
├── When the owner recovers unsold inventory after shutdown
│   └── It should preserve already assigned prizes.
├── When a closed auction receives new activity
│   └── It should reject bids draws and deposits.
└── When a refund transfer fails
    └── It should preserve the refund credit.
